---
layout: base
---

<!-- Welcome / Hero -->
<section class="section hero-statement anim-reveal" id="welcome">
    <h1 class="hero-greeting">
        Hi, I'm Aitor.
    </h1>
    <p class="hero-text">
        Developer, game maker, and occasional teacher based in the Canary Islands.
    </p>
    <p class="hero-text">
        Over the past 15 years I've worked on more than 80 projects: small experiments, shipped titles on PC, VR, Nintendo Switch, mobile, and web. Learned a lot along the way.
    </p>
    <p class="hero-text">
        My roots are in game development. Lately I've been working as an AI Engineer, building tooling, multi-agent workflows, and trying to understand where all of this is actually going.
    </p>

    <nav class="hero-links">
        <a href="#work">&rarr; Timeline</a>
        <a href="/tag/slides/">&rarr; Slides</a>
    </nav>
</section>

<!-- Timeline -->
<section class="section anim-reveal" id="work">
    <header class="section-header">
        <span class="section-index">[01 &middot; Timeline]</span>
    </header>
    <div class="work-timeline">

        <div class="work-entry work-entry--current" x-data="{ open: true }" :class="open ? 'work-entry--open' : ''">
            <button type="button" class="work-entry-head" @click="open = !open" :aria-expanded="open">
                <span class="work-entry-dot"></span>
                <span class="work-entry-name">AI &amp; Developer Tools</span>
                <span class="work-entry-year">2025 – Present</span>
            </button>
            <div class="work-entry-body" :class="open ? 'work-entry-body--open' : ''">
                <div class="work-entry-body-inner">
                    <div class="work-entry-tags">
                        <span>python</span><span>fastapi</span><span>langchain</span><span>automation</span>
                    </div>
                    <p class="work-entry-desc">AI Engineer at INNO-VERSE, building developer tooling for AI agents and multi-agent workflows with Python, LangChain, and FastAPI.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="work-entry" x-data="{ open: false }" :class="open ? 'work-entry--open' : ''">
            <button type="button" class="work-entry-head" @click="open = !open" :aria-expanded="open">
                <span class="work-entry-dot"></span>
                <span class="work-entry-name">PlayMedusa</span>
                <span class="work-entry-year">2011 – Present</span>
            </button>
            <div class="work-entry-body" :class="open ? 'work-entry-body--open' : ''">
                <div class="work-entry-body-inner">
                    <div class="work-entry-tags">
                        <span>unity</span><span>c#</span><span>vr</span><span>steam</span><span>switch</span>
                    </div>
                    <p class="work-entry-desc">My professional home since 2011. Developed our own games while also providing design and development services to external clients, integrating with existing teams and codebases to ensure successful delivery across mobile, VR, console, and web.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="work-entry" x-data="{ open: false }" :class="open ? 'work-entry--open' : ''">
            <button type="button" class="work-entry-head" @click="open = !open" :aria-expanded="open">
                <span class="work-entry-dot"></span>
                <span class="work-entry-name">Exel Gaming Accelerator</span>
                <span class="work-entry-year">Mar 2025 – Oct 2025</span>
            </button>
            <div class="work-entry-body" :class="open ? 'work-entry-body--open' : ''">
                <div class="work-entry-body-inner">
                    <div class="work-entry-tags">
                        <span>mentorship</span><span>entrepreneurship</span><span>gaming</span>
                    </div>
                    <p class="work-entry-desc">Entrepreneur in Residence at Exel by Merak in Riyadh. Mentored startup teams on technical strategy, advised on production and project development, and helped refine accelerator workflows and best practices.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="work-entry" x-data="{ open: false }" :class="open ? 'work-entry--open' : ''">
            <button type="button" class="work-entry-head" @click="open = !open" :aria-expanded="open">
                <span class="work-entry-dot"></span>
                <span class="work-entry-name">Aurita Games</span>
                <span class="work-entry-year">2020 – 2025</span>
            </button>
            <div class="work-entry-body" :class="open ? 'work-entry-body--open' : ''">
                <div class="work-entry-body-inner">
                    <div class="work-entry-tags">
                        <span>unity</span><span>defold</span><span>product-strategy</span>
                    </div>
                    <p class="work-entry-desc">Founded and ran a micro-studio. Handled design, client relationships, and multiplatform delivery across 80+ projects. Stepped away in late 2025 to focus on AI full-time.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="work-entry" x-data="{ open: false }" :class="open ? 'work-entry--open' : ''">
            <button type="button" class="work-entry-head" @click="open = !open" :aria-expanded="open">
                <span class="work-entry-dot"></span>
                <span class="work-entry-name">30 Parallel Games</span>
                <span class="work-entry-year">2018 – 2020</span>
            </button>
            <div class="work-entry-body" :class="open ? 'work-entry-body--open' : ''">
                <div class="work-entry-body-inner">
                    <div class="work-entry-tags">
                        <span>unity</span><span>photon</span><span>vr-networking</span>
                    </div>
                    <p class="work-entry-desc">Implemented real-time multiplayer using Photon for Terra Alia, a language-learning RPG on Steam and Meta Quest. Also built a React dashboard and automated daemons for Bitponies, a blockchain-based collectible game.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="work-entry" x-data="{ open: false }" :class="open ? 'work-entry--open' : ''">
            <button type="button" class="work-entry-head" @click="open = !open" :aria-expanded="open">
                <span class="work-entry-dot"></span>
                <span class="work-entry-name">Barbie™ Mobile Games</span>
                <span class="work-entry-year">2017</span>
            </button>
            <div class="work-entry-body" :class="open ? 'work-entry-body--open' : ''">
                <div class="work-entry-body-inner">
                    <div class="work-entry-tags">
                        <span>unity</span><span>mobile</span><span>team-leadership</span>
                    </div>
                    <p class="work-entry-desc">Led a remote team of five developers at Relativity Studios. Contributed the final content patches to Barbie™ You Can Be Anything as it passed 10 million downloads, and improved the narrative tooling behind American Girl World.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="work-entry" x-data="{ open: false }" :class="open ? 'work-entry--open' : ''">
            <button type="button" class="work-entry-head" @click="open = !open" :aria-expanded="open">
                <span class="work-entry-dot"></span>
                <span class="work-entry-name">Teaching &amp; Mentoring</span>
                <span class="work-entry-year">2014 – 2025</span>
            </button>
            <div class="work-entry-body" :class="open ? 'work-entry-body--open' : ''">
                <div class="work-entry-body-inner">
                    <div class="work-entry-tags">
                        <span>ulpgc</span><span>lectures</span><span>curriculum-design</span>
                    </div>
                    <p class="work-entry-desc">A year-long course in game design and programming with Unity3D and C# at ULPGC (2014-2020), a 110-hour specialist course at EOI (2022), Unity3D courses with ACADEVI, mentoring at local game jams, and startup mentoring at the Exel Gaming Accelerator (2025).</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

    </div>
</section>

<!-- Notebook -->
<section class="section anim-reveal" id="notes">
    <header class="section-header">
        <span class="section-index">[02 &middot; Notebook]</span>
    </header>
    <div class="posts-list">
        {%- set latestPosts = collections._posts | sortBy('date', true) %}
        {%- for post in latestPosts %}
        {%- if loop.index0 < 6 %}
        <a href="{{ post.url }}" class="post-row">
            <span class="post-row-title">{{ post.data.title }}</span>
            <span class="post-row-tags">
                {%- for tag in post.data.tags | filterPrivateTags %}
                <span class="post-row-tag">{{ tag }}</span>
                {%- endfor %}
            </span>
        </a>
        {%- endif %}
        {%- endfor %}
    </div>
    <a href="/writing/" class="posts-more">→ All notes ({{ collections._posts | languageFilter | length }})</a>
</section>

<!-- Background & Context -->
<section class="section section--divided anim-reveal" id="summary-context">
    <header class="section-header">
        <span class="section-index">[03 &middot; Snapshot]</span>
    </header>

    <!-- Career Metrics + Observation -->
    <div class="metadata-metrics" x-data="observation">
        <span class="metadata-metrics-header">[Career at a glance]</span>
        <div class="metadata-metrics-body">
            <div class="metadata-metrics-left">
                <div class="metadata-metrics-numbers">
                    <div>
                        <div class="metadata-metrics-number">15+</div>
                        <div class="metadata-metrics-context">years of activity</div>
                    </div>
                    <div>
                        <div class="metadata-metrics-number">80+</div>
                        <div class="metadata-metrics-context">shipped products</div>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="metadata-metrics-platforms">
                    <span>PC</span><span aria-hidden="true" style="opacity:.4">·</span>
                    <span>VR</span><span aria-hidden="true" style="opacity:.4">·</span>
                    <span>Nintendo Switch</span><span aria-hidden="true" style="opacity:.4">·</span>
                    <span>Mobile</span><span aria-hidden="true" style="opacity:.4">·</span>
                    <span>Web</span>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="metadata-metrics-quote">
                <span class="metadata-metrics-quote-label">Observation</span>
                <p x-html="text"></p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Archive Grid -->
    <div class="metadata-grid">

        <!-- active_stack -->
        <div class="metadata-card">
            <span class="metadata-card-header">[Current stack]</span>
            <div class="metadata-card-tags">
                <span>python</span><span>fastapi</span><span>langchain</span><span>picotron</span><span>pico-8</span>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- native_expertise -->
        <div class="metadata-card">
            <span class="metadata-card-header">[Game dev roots]</span>
            <div class="metadata-card-tags">
                <span>c#</span><span>unity3d</span><span>vr netcode</span><span>lua</span><span>mobile</span><span>c++</span><span>webgl</span>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- career_domains -->
        <div class="metadata-card metadata-card--wide">
            <span class="metadata-card-header">[Domains]</span>
            <div class="metadata-card-tags">
                <span>game development</span><span>ai systems</span><span>developer tooling</span><span>education</span><span>technical leadership</span><span>vr</span><span>automation</span><span>interactive design</span>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- availability -->
        <div class="metadata-card">
            <span class="metadata-card-header">[Availability]</span>
            <div class="metadata-availability">
                <div><span class="avail-key">status</span><span class="avail-val">employed · not looking</span></div>
                <div><span class="avail-key">timezone</span><span class="avail-val">UTC+1 · Canary Islands</span></div>
                <div><span class="avail-key">preferred</span><span class="avail-val">full-time · remote</span></div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- environment_nodes -->
        <div class="metadata-card metadata-card--environment">
            <img src="/assets/img/cats.jpg" alt="Marvel &amp; Haru" loading="lazy" eleventy:ignore class="metadata-card-bg">
            <span class="metadata-card-header">[Office staff]</span>
            <span class="metadata-card-sub">
                Marvel &amp; Haru, now providing remote support from my parents' place. Best cats in the world.
            </span>
        </div>

    </div>
</section>
